no-vendor-commands: disable the vendor command TPM2_Vendor_TCG_Test

Classification: profile setting.

tpm-rs implements no vendor commands, so TPM_CAP_COMMANDS and
TPM_PT_VENDOR_COMMANDS must not list one.
